<code>assert !c.isEmpty() => this.size() == c.size() && \forall int i; 0 <= i && i < c.size(); this.get(i).equals(c.toArray()[i]);</code>

This assert statement ensures that if the collection `c` is not empty, the constructed `ArrayList` has the same size as `c` and each element in the `ArrayList` matches the corresponding element in `c`.
